      "readme": {
        "en": "Bring your ceiling fan into your daily routines. Set a gentle breeze for the evening or switch it off with a Homey Flow.\n\nThis community app currently supports only the tested LuxVen 433 MHz configuration with remote DIP switches 1–3 down and 4 up. Other models and DIP settings are not verified. The displayed speed is the last command sent through Homey; the original remote and actual motor state are not monitored.\n"
      },
      "description": {
        "de": "Eine frische Brise, passend zu deinem Alltag",
        "en": "A fresh breeze that fits your day"
      },
      "category": "climate",
      "brandColor": "#263238",
      "icon": "https://apps.homeycdn.net/app/com.marco.luxven/2/ac4b73a7-640f-4c9e-9067-73da34d6655d/assets/icon.svg",
      "imageSmall": "https://apps.homeycdn.net/app/com.marco.luxven/2/ac4b73a7-640f-4c9e-9067-73da34d6655d/assets/images/small.png",
      "imageLarge": "https://apps.homeycdn.net/app/com.marco.luxven/2/ac4b73a7-640f-4c9e-9067-73da34d6655d/assets/images/large.png",
